  "statement": "# Harvest Ledger — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nPlan a small farm day under a finite clock, invest effort in crops and animals, sell the result, and meet a visible ledger target.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA bounded top-down farming/economy game with tools, production choices, time cost, profit or objective pressure, failure, and campaign completion.\n\n## Required controls\n\nThis task requires at least 2 declared extended actions in `gb_levels.json.extended_actions` (extra InputMap verbs beyond the eight canonical `gb_*` actions, each bound to a real key and read in gameplay code) covering: discrete tool-selection verbs for at least two different tools, rather than one context-sensitive action. Choose your own stable ids. Holding every declared extra from frame 0 must not clear the game.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose the farm layout, crop and animal numbers, day count, prices, target, and visual composition.\n"
}
